 (goal
  "Resolve `file.py#Class.method` and `outer.inner` through the Python worker: span from the first decorator to end_lineno, hash over ast.dump without attributes (comments and formatting invisible), ambiguity reported with the candidates instead of first-match; method `python`, no ~heuristic label.")
